  <p class="eyebrow">Photos</p>
  <h1>Before, during, after</h1>
  <p class="lede">Nearly three hundred pictures from the collective's archives: the Agorians' cameras, the albums of the Facebook page, Christian's photo library, the websites. They are grouped by chapter, in the order of time. The dates come from the photos' metadata when it exists.</p>

  {chapters.map(([title, intro, photos]) => (
    <section>
      <h2 class="eyebrow" style="margin-top:2.5rem">{title}</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="font-size:1rem" set:html={intro}></p>
      {photos.length > 0 && (
        <div class="gallery">
          {photos.filter(p => p[2] !== 'hidden').map(([file, caption, cls]) => (
            <figure class={cls}><img src={`/img/${file}`} alt={caption} loading="lazy" /><figcaption>{caption}</figcaption></figure>
          ))}
        </div>
      )}
    </section>
  ))}

  <div class="note">The photos are in web resolution (1,400 pixels at most) and their location metadata was removed. The originals are kept by Christian Brochu. Anyone who recognizes themselves in a photo and would like it removed can write to info@consulmac.com.</div>
</Base>
